@base <http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/tara-acupoints-upper.owl> .

<http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/tara-acupoints-upper.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                                             rdfs:comment """This file includes an upper-level reference module for the TARA Acupoints Ontology. It contains a subset of the Basic Formal Ontology (BFO) and a minimal subset of object properties from the Relations Ontology (BFO/RO Core). For metadata/annotation properties, it includes a subset of the Information Artifact Ontology (IAO).
- About RO Core: https://github.com/oborel/obo-relations/wiki/ROCore
- About BFO: https://obofoundry.org/ontology/bfo.html
- About IAO: https://github.com/information-artifact-ontology/IAO"""@en .

